Author: Theodore Nguyen-Cao <theo@guidedclinical.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 11 15:38:13 2026 -0400

    OR-2755: recategorize rule guidance categories
    
    The analytics error-count and monthly-breakdown reports join
    rule_definitions.guidance_category live, so these moves re-attribute
    historical firings as well as future ones: past Monitoring counts shift
    into Diabetes Management and Uncategorized shrinks. Previously published
    breakdowns will not reconcile with a re-run.
    
    i-dantrolene-default-dose is absent because #4341 already moves it to
    Wrong Dose.

